      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 05 · AI Proposal Generator\nTurns discovery-call notes into a structured sales proposal, emails the draft to the account owner and logs it.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/proposal-generator` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"client\": \"Acme Logistics\",\n \"owner_email\": \"owner@yourco.com\",\n \"notes\": \"Pain: manual dispatch, 40 trucks, wants tracking + auto invoicing. Budget ~15k. Decision in 6 weeks.\"\n}\n```"
      }
